    # v410 (09/11/2026) -- THE PRE-REGISTERED HUBBLE-RATIO TEST (H0DN x BG1; D72, E30, D76): pre-registered; no observed data read. The numbers come from this rite's core (the record h0dn_bg1_v410), never typed. Nothing here moves the gate. The section comes AFTER the IALD2 section.
    _rh410 = core.get("h0dn_bg1_v410") or {}
    _vh410 = _rh410.get("values") or {}
    _mh410 = {c_.get("id"): c_.get("ok") for c_ in ((_rh410.get("mechanics") or {}).get("checks") or [])}
    _dh410 = {d_.get("modelo"): d_ for d_ in (_vh410.get("D_esperado") or []) if isinstance(d_, dict)}
    _nh410 = lambda x_, k_=4: ("%%.%df" % k_ % x_) if isinstance(x_, float) else r"\text{n/a}"
    _ph410 = lambda x_: ("%.1f" % (100.0 * x_)) + r"\,\%" if isinstance(x_, float) else r"\text{n/a}"
    _bh410 = lambda x_: (r"\textsf{True}" if x_ is True else r"\textsf{False}" if x_ is False else r"\text{n/a}")
    _th410 = lambda x_: "n/a" if x_ is None else str(x_).replace(chr(92), "").replace("_", r"\_\allowbreak{}")
    _b0h410 = _dh410.get("published_baseline") or {}; _c0h410 = _dh410.get("free_cepheid_host_differential_bias") or {}
    s.append(r"\section*{The pre-registered Hubble-ratio test with the distance network (H0DN $\times$ BG1)}")
    s.append(r"\addcontentsline{toc}{section}{The pre-registered Hubble-ratio test with the distance network (H0DN $\times$ BG1)}")
    s.append((r"\textbf{In this run the H0DN record did NOT seal: what follows is the statement, not a seal.} " if _rh410.get("all_verified") is not True else r"")
             + r"\textbf{What enters.} \textsf{[INPUT]} The operator, 09/11/2026 (our translation): as to the v410 test, I agree with everything you said; you may give the order to Kimi K3 Pro. \textsf{[REAL]} The H0DN $\times$ BG1 test of the local/background Hubble ratio enters \emph{pre-registered; no observed data read} (" + _th410(_V410_H0DN_CONTRACT["frase_alcance_en"]) + r"): "
             r"the design of the Codex astra-bell of 06/11, frozen before any look at the data (\texttt{FREEZE\_R2}: " + str(_vh410.get("n_pinos_freeze") if isinstance(_vh410.get("n_pinos_freeze"), int) else "n/a") + r" pins; " + str(_vh410.get("n_pinos") if isinstance(_vh410.get("n_pinos"), int) else "n/a") + r" checked in this rite, with \texttt{FREEZE\_R2} itself and the delivery; the embedded ones by sha256, the on-disk ones if present). "
             r"The law: null $H_{\rm local}/H_{\rm bg}=1$; TGL alternative $K=E(z_\star)^{2\beta/3}$, $\beta=\alpha\sqrt e$ at runtime, zero free parameters, $z_\star$ and $K$ checked against the Fase 9 V1 already in \texttt{um.py}: $K=" + _nh410(_vh410.get("K"), 6) + r"$, $\log_{10}K=" + _nh410(_vh410.get("log10K"), 6) + r"$. "
             r"The statistic: $Z=(\hat h-\log_{10}H_{\rm bg})/\sigma_{\rm null}$, one-sided, threshold $5$; two models (the published one; the free Cepheid differential bias), none selected.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{The prospective, synthetic power.} \textsf{[DERIVED]} Reproduced in this rite from the frozen estimator: expected $D=" + _nh410(_b0h410.get("D"), 3) + r"$ (published) and $" + _nh410(_c0h410.get("D"), 3) + r"$ (free Cepheid); analytic power $\Phi(D-5)=" + _ph410(_b0h410.get("poder_analitico")) + r"$ and $" + _ph410(_c0h410.get("poder_analitico")) + r"$; "
             r"the Monte Carlo power of the delivery (" + _ph410(_b0h410.get("poder_mc_entrega")) + r" and " + _ph410(_c0h410.get("poder_mc_entrega")) + r") within its own 95\% CI (a check, not a recomputation); null tail $\Phi(-5)=" + ("%.3e" % _vh410["cauda_nula_analitica"] if isinstance(_vh410.get("cauda_nula_analitica"), float) else r"\text{n/a}").replace("e-0", r"\times 10^{-").replace("e-", r"\times 10^{-") + (r"}" if isinstance(_vh410.get("cauda_nula_analitica"), float) else "") + r"$. "
             r"All of it conditional on the published covariance model (block-diagonal; local/background independence assumed, not measured); no observed deviation.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{The frozen verdict function.} \textsf{[REAL]} The first branch that matches decides: inconclusive by systematics while the physical covariance is not closed (G3/G4) or the vector lies outside the support; the law $K$ falsified at $5\sigma$ at this sensitivity if $|z_{\rm TGL}|\ge 5$; underpowered if $D<5$; "
             r"the \emph{reading} of the $5\sigma$ --- $\beta_{\rm TGL}$ proved in nature (validity, not creditation) at $n\sigma$, in the language of academic physics, discriminating from $\Lambda$CDM, zero free parameters, use-novel --- if $z_{\rm null}\ge 5$ and $|z_{\rm TGL}|\le 1.96$; discriminates from $\Lambda$CDM with $K$ in tension between $2$ and $5\sigma$; "
             r"not discriminated at the available sensitivity, with the deviation band. The word of the ledger of charges goes in the \texttt{outcome} field, never in the head (E30; D76, the operator, our translation: the seal has to say beta-TGL proved in nature, it is simple, as you said, it was read). "
             r"Tested in this rite on " + str(len(_vh410.get("vetores_c6") or []) if _vh410.get("vetores_c6") else "n/a") + r" deterministic vectors covering the six branches " + _bh410(_mh410.get("c6")) + r"; sha256 of the source text: \texttt{" + _th410((_vh410.get("veredito_h0dn_source_sha256") or "")[:16]) + r"}.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{What is missing, and the use-novelty reservation.} \textsf{[OPEN]} The observed vector $y_{\rm obs}$ (255 rows, by the upstream code), the joint physical covariance without duplicating the Cepheid information (G3/G4) and the IDs (G1/G2): the order to Kimi is pinned by sha256; the opening belongs to a future version, through the function already frozen. " + _th410(_V410_H0DN_CONTRACT["frase_parede_en"]) + r". "
             r"\textbf{The certified power (D96, the operator's order of 10/11).} \textsf{[INPUT]} The operator (our translation): if it has no predictive power we will not run it; a test with real discriminating predictive power. \textsf{[INPUT, D96]} " + _th410(_V410_H0DN_CONTRACT["frase_poder_en"]) + r". The order is pinned by sha256 (\texttt{" + _th410(_V410_H0DN_CONTRACT["ordem_kimi_02"]["sha256"][:16]) + r"}), not embedded, and in the rite nothing of it is read. The return (10 Nov): " + _th410(_V410_H0DN_CONTRACT["frase_retorno_en"]) + r". The checked order (03B) is pinned by sha256 (\texttt{" + _th410(_V410_H0DN_CONTRACT["ordem_kimi_03b"]["sha256"][:16]) + r"}), not embedded, and in the rite nothing of it is read. "
             r"The public H0DN aggregate has been known since Oct/2025; $K$ has no fitted parameter; the pre-registration in this sealed version is what counts (the law of proof of 05/10: retrodiction without fit). The route “spectrum $\times$ photometry coherence” stands as NOT\_TESTABLE ($\eta=1$): it is not the test. "
             r"\textbf{Reservations, stated.} No observed vector is read or looked for in this version; the power is prospective and synthetic, of the published covariance (which does not admit the real vector), and is not a certified power; proved in nature (validity, not creditation) is never TGL confirmed, which is creditation (the judgement from outside, which \texttt{um.py} does not give); \texttt{NOT\_FALSIFIED} is never confirmation; the gate does not move. "
             r"\textbf{What the record checks in this rite.} \textsf{[REAL]} pins " + _bh410(_mh410.get("c1")) + r"; $K$ from $\beta$ " + _bh410(_mh410.get("c2")) + r"; the $\sigma$ of the two models " + _bh410(_mh410.get("c3")) + r"; $D$ " + _bh410(_mh410.get("c4")) + r"; power " + _bh410(_mh410.get("c5")) + r"; the verdict function " + _bh410(_mh410.get("c6")) + r"; no observed vector " + _bh410(_mh410.get("c7")) + r"; the guard " + _bh410(_mh410.get("c8")) + r"; the gate " + _bh410(_mh410.get("c9")) + r"; the Kimi route " + _bh410(_mh410.get("c10")) + r"; the joint rule " + _bh410(_mh410.get("c11")) + r"; the text " + _bh410(_mh410.get("c12")) + r". Verdict: \texttt{" + _th410(_rh410.get("verdict")) + r"}.")
    # v410 (09/11/2026) -- D80: THE DOCUMENTARY HMS/13 RECEIPT (h0dn_fontes_hms13_v410), additive and posterior to FREEZE_R2: documentary source coverage, not a closed physical covariance; nothing opened. Numbers from this rite's core; in the rite nothing is read from Kimi's delivery.
    _rf410 = core.get("h0dn_fontes_hms13_v410") or {}
    _vf410 = _rf410.get("values") or {}
